**This is not legal advice.** It is a provenance-and-compatibility analysis:
where each file came from, what licence travelled with it, and which choices
that provenance leaves open. It was written by the author of the code, not by
counsel, and a reader who needs a legal conclusion needs counsel.

**Marks.** 讀 is read out of a file in this repository, a pinned source tree or
