## 3. rlxfw's changes to Realtek's GPL-2.0 files — derivative where they touch

**Covered:** `config/rlxfw-marks.tsv`, `config/host-compat/*.patch`,
`config/busybox-patches/0001-udhcpd-drop-notify_file-system-hook.patch` and
`config/rlxfw-kernel.delta`.

These four files are not copies of vendor source; they are declarations of how
to change it. 量 they describe changes to **24 distinct vendor files**: 11
